# bpadmin: a minimal BP node with a single endpoint.
# No convergence-layer adapter is defined: the test never sends or receives
# over a network, it only opens ipn:1.1 and blocks in bp_receive so that
# interrupt/close behaviour can be exercised.
#
# The ipn:1.64 / ipn:1.65 endpoints exist so the CFDP UT task (bputa) can
# register; the CFDP cases exercise the _cfdp handle lifecycle and the global
# event interrupt, not real file delivery, so no CL is needed.
1
a scheme ipn 'ipnfw' 'ipnadminep'
a endpoint ipn:1.1 x
a endpoint ipn:1.64 x
a endpoint ipn:1.65 x
s
